Error [E0202]: Cannot write to `items` — it does not have the write-access marker `&`; required before calling `.next()`
  --> tests/ui/iter_next_immutable_binding.jet:5:12
    |
  5 |     print(&items.next())
    |            ^^^^^
 Why: This method edits the value it's called on; the write-access marker `&` is required
 Fix: Declare `items := ...`
